{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "a6cb3dbead673b58ab6c6f26bbad39a36e3f5319138ace880641da2424fe26da", "ja": "自分だけの道の先で", "zh": "在独属于自己的道路前方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c6969433330f6675784eda0269a120ad7030514c7ec268f6342804b9a2dea8cf", "ja": "音楽イベントが終わり、日常が戻ってきた。\nトランプタワーで遊ぶ翼と瑞希。\nそして、呆れた様子で眺めるジュリア。\n自らの想いで日々成長していくアイドル達を\nプロデューサーは誇らしく思うのだった。", "zh": "音乐活动结束后，日常生活恢复了。\n翼和瑞希在玩纸牌搭塔。\n而茱莉亚则一脸无奈地看着她们。\n偶像们凭借自己的心意，一天天不断成长，\n制作人对此感到无比自豪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1000_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9376b1baf297ef38cb8dc6caa4cad2706b443aa42a22d5cad96e17dcc30a9095", "ja": "できた～！　みてみて、瑞希ちゃん！", "zh": "完成啦～！快看快看，瑞希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "267263b0b5f85be8bdfc4d36024097f62a280dccc4c81dd665bc9ff3eea9aaf1", "ja": "1、2……3段のトランプタワーですか。\nなかなかやりますね、伊吹さん。", "zh": "1、2……是3层的纸牌塔啊。\n挺有一手呢，伊吹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f3ec4736a97d48e71cbde539bd272063b61683fd1a218331b48a01dd2b8b7625", "ja": "えへへ、すごいでしょ～♪\n瑞希ちゃんは……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，很厉害吧～♪\n瑞希她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "620b4ea4f6ef8da118ac011c5f3e94832d2f21fb2ff4952d79979bbb639b7d6d", "ja": "私は5段です。\nまだまだ伊吹さんに負けるわけにはいきませんので。", "zh": "我是5段。还不能输给伊吹小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "1edb4684f6cb7a8286bddf3513810f1ce064b5b9c9fb1940d4e03230fc68ae0a", "ja": "ったく、何やってんだか。", "zh": "真是的，搞什么呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1005_406gsp", "source_sha256": "a4a4d831424d939520f47ea504155b5c87cfe3e327e2f7e66f2b7157dbff2982", "ja": "まあまあ。楽しそうでいいじゃないか。\n瑞希に聞いたが、翼は1つも作れなかったそうだ。", "zh": "别急别急。看起来挺开心的，这不是很好嘛。\n我听瑞希说，翼连1个都没做出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "c87a8340eddf2abdbffeb4885c6f1168fdc4060e4d9c270575c266df3a2f065a", "ja": "……何が？", "zh": "……什么东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1007_406gsp", "source_sha256": "54658ace0023c1fd5b0921750c40aed84cf90ba9025a485951177a9105b0136c", "ja": "トランプタワーだよ。段数が増えると\n崩れやすくなるから、忍耐も必要らしい。", "zh": "是纸牌塔啊。层数越多就越容易倒塌，所以好像也需要耐心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1008_406gsp", "source_sha256": "d01ecd9a9718ba9d2dfeef0f910cd0cc219e16ba3f6cbfd9f0fe9538af557691", "ja": "3段作るにも、相応の根気がいる……。\nずいぶん、成長したもんだ。", "zh": "就算只搭3层，也得有相应的毅力才行……\n她真的成长了不少啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "83b2f29bdecf494387dfb3e43f516a42a38fcbb03f01e21124728556d9add28f", "ja": "へえ……。なるほどね。", "zh": "哦……原来如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1010_406gsp", "source_sha256": "44c7a89ad81f8352444f61581e54538dc54347ce3fbcdbebfb8be5816e83f426", "ja": "この前のライブも、かなり盛り上がったみたいだし。\nどこまで行くんだろうな。", "zh": "上次的演出似乎也相当热闹。  \n不知道会走到哪一步呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "580a55154adb9faef6d89cd94713c3c14ea24d00a88c83f151c975258f401e24", "ja": "……この先は、あんたがしっかり見届けろよな。\n本物の大人なんだからさ。あたしは……。", "zh": "……接下来，你可得好好见证到底啊。\n毕竟你是真正的大人嘛。我啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "28089227ef9c91a3b76473362d200d0e11510b8ac6dd49b3887c197735fdc666", "ja": "ジュリア～ノ♪　そろそろレッスンの時間だよ。", "zh": "茱莉亚～♪　差不多到练习时间了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "9ad2d022884872830dac4f98e853c4e463633451dff4d9ff9eaac4f3236bec63", "ja": "お、もうそんな時間か。\nえっと……なあ、翼。今日じゃなきゃダメか？", "zh": "哦，已经到这个时间了吗。\n那个……喂，翼。非得今天不可吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1056399e3f5d76929d5e5929d1eafbce923c6d6a67a5a2c7f388210971b3a907", "ja": "もう～、打ち上げでダンスを教えてほしいって言った\nのはジュリアーノでしょ？　ワガママ言わないの！", "zh": "真是的～，在庆功宴上说想要我教跳舞\n的可是茱莉亚吧？不准任性！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "9e6efdff3f22b23910c9bc1ff2915e06e733ed9e29f736c72dc9b57ea6c62b73", "ja": "いや、そうなんだけど……。\nワガママとか、どの口が言えるんだ！？", "zh": "嗯，话是这么说没错……  \n你居然好意思说别人任性！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "b4d1bbb0d763119c08765f0375dd1f064315b1ee2cf83e3454082a328dc2da9f", "ja": "とりあえず、私もお供しましょう。\nいざという時には、私の手品で場を和ませます。", "zh": "总之，我也陪你一起去吧。\n万一遇到什么情况，我就用魔术来缓和气氛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1017_406gsp", "source_sha256": "1180a4704fe99eb606b9bc8e26d5f4fdbac2dd1ab6a561a4f8b959c4db02c96d", "ja": "ははっ。頼んだぞ、瑞希！", "zh": "哈哈，那就拜托你了，瑞希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1018_406gsp", "source_sha256": "201499ddcb6ac3ac0e3a798551e46f27b500f0525ccd8772153911b1862221f6", "ja": "（真剣だからこそ、迷って悩んで、ぶつかり合って。\nそうして、一歩ずつ大人になっていく）", "zh": "（正因为认真，才会迷茫、烦恼，彼此碰撞。就这样，一步一步地成长为大人）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_07_1019_406gsp", "source_sha256": "609bc8a54ad62e918a4ea349afb23a6b7789eac2559d03575f941594e41ac61c", "ja": "（その手で掴み取った自由の翼で、\nそれぞれの空に向かって……！）", "zh": "（用那双手抓住的自由之翼，向着各自的天空……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
